@* A section RCL does NOT inherit the host's Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. Omitting a line
   here ships broken markup with a green build and no runtime error — see design §1/§2.
   None of these views carries a `<vc:` element, so no view component had to move; the
   `_TabbedMarkdownDocuments` partial they render lives in Humans.UI and resolves by path
   across application parts. Guarded by ConsentPageRenderTests (step 12).

   Two localizers by design (design §15 step 3b, Governance's variant): the section owns
   its 36 Consent_* / ConsentReview_* / ConsentIndex_* keys, and `Nav_Consents` stays in
   SharedResource because Humans.UI's login partial renders it too. *@
@using Humans.Application.Extensions
@using Humans.Consent
@using Humans.Consent.Contracts
@using Humans.Consent.Controllers
@using Humans.Consent.Models
@using Humans.Domain.Enums
@using Humans.UI
@using Humans.UI.Extensions
@using Humans.UI.Models
@using Humans.UI.Models.Tables
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@inject IStringLocalizer<ConsentResource> Localizer
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> SharedLocalizer
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, Humans.Interfaces
